MI20 Arbo
=========

A documentary production-plan (PPD) and bordereau (BX) work tool inspired by
the Access IHM 1.6.6 application known as BASE ARBO MI20.

This software is an independent replacement. It does not claim Bombardier,
CAF, or RATP ownership of branding, trademarks, or production data.

Demo seed data is synthetic and is not a dump of any production database.

Template file names (for example MI20_BORD_TEMPLATE_M5_V12.xls) are referenced
for operational compatibility with existing folder layouts only.
